4x1000 credits of tradeable goods (printed !D4xlOOO) are in GM Notes. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: one weapon for each W.P.; bedroll, belt, boots, cloak or cape (often fur) and personal items have no row; the good quality riding horse and the one unearthly riding animal (probably a Horned Steed) under Vehicle have no row. The armor choice offers this book''s two homemade armor rows; the modern armor alternative is in the note. The silver cross, tinted goggles and lighter use the nearest catalog rows and say so in their notes. || NOT STORED: the clan size note (1D6x10 members, tribes of 1D6x1000 up to 18,000) and the Megahorse line (about 5% ever get one) are background."
